file tools/ales_stereo_duplicate_witness.rish the witness — builds, runs selftest, asserts the GREEN ales-stereo-duplicate line.
file active-designing/20260815-020930_fill-ales120-lotus-stereo-duplicate.md the self-approved design read for this rung.
file lotus/README.md front door synced — ALES120 status entry and roster paragraph.
